In article <1991Jun12.787.2147@canrem.uucp> john.russell@canrem.UUCP (John Russell) writes:
> Can anyone provide some not-totally-spoiler hints how to use religion?

Ah religion!  It has baffled numerous generations of man over time.  
But seriously.  Praying can get you out of many nasty situations (if your
deity likes you that is).  Don't pray too often of your god will get annoyed
with you.  Offering monster corpses at the altar of you deity if very 
usefull.  It makes the god happy with you, and the higher the level of
the monster you scarifice the happier that god will get.  Sometimes, if
you god is sufficiently happy, he will give you a present.  It is also
a very good idea to donate large sums of money to your local church
(that's a room with an altar and a priest).  Finally, if you are sufficently
evil to perform a human sacrifice (no, not a human sacrifice!) you may
summon a demon who, depending on how lucky you feel, punk, may grant you
a wish.



